1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,213
The surface summer does not end. Rim rations water by the cup. The searchlights stay on, because no one has ordered beauty, only current.

2
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:13,617
What remains of the Compact demands the river as relief. The message uses the word share. The annex uses the word transfer. Nima reads both, and takes the measuring stick with her.

3
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:14,043
The house opens cisterns at the gate for anyone who comes without a weapon. The rule fits on one line. People stand in the heat and decide what to do with their hands.

4
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:13,617
Adler's faction lays a private pipe by night, from a side bore toward the camp tanks. It is quieter than a speech. It is meant to make the cistern line look unnecessary.

5
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:14,468
By the third day the pipe runs brown, then runs dry. Silt closes what a signature opened. The cisterns do not silt. They are cleaned by people whose names are on the house map.

6
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:14,468
Nima's granddaughter carries the same notched stick. She calls the height of the water by the old marks. The new marks, painted by the camp, are lower, because they begin from a different thirst.

7
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:14,043
Rifles gather in a pile beside the gate, not as a ceremony, but because the cistern keepers will not serve a person who is holding one. Thirst does the rest of the persuading.

8
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:11,915
A sheet is posted in Rim with the volume the river supposedly owes. The number is large. It has a seal. It does not have a wet edge.

9
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:14,468
The granddaughter paints the real height beside the sealed number, in river water and ash, so it will fade and have to be written again. People check it the way they check the weather.

10
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:15,745
Several offices try to rename the river in honor of the relief effort. The names do not stick. Children on both sides still use the word Nima taught her granddaughter, which is simply the word for here.
